# Native Settings > Apps (task 014 P3d; P3e: Installed / Available split) without the Store backend
# (src/harness_apps.cpp, HARNESS_APPS missing): the status line says "Store backend not installed", the Apps root has
# no counts, Installed says "The Store is needed (backend missing)"; the Sources level opens, nothing in it runs (Enter
# on "Sync my sources" does nothing).
# Review only: no golden.
title settings native apps backend missing
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env HARNESS_APPS missing
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1000
shot apps_missing_root
header apps_missing_root "Settings > Apps" Apps
key ENTER
wait 500
shot apps_missing
header apps_missing "Settings > Apps > Installed" "Apps > Installed" Installed
key LEFT
wait 300
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 500
shot apps_missing_sources
